 continue to pass\n- High contrast toggle tested in Game.test.tsx (3 tests)\n- CSS selector testing verified in component tests\n- Manual testing confirms high contrast mode properly applies across all UI components"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","title":"IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md","metadata":{"diagnostics":{"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/types/index.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/CanvasGrid.tsx":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/state.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/level.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/settings.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/simulation.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/audio.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/audio.test.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/simulation.test.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/interaction.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/flux.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/GridInteraction.tsx":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/FluxDisplay.tsx":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/TransitionOverlay.tsx":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/phase.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/hooks/useTransition.ts":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/GlassHUD.tsx":[],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/SettingsPanel.tsx":[{"range":{"start":{"line":826,"character":18},"end":{"line":826,"character":28}},"message":"'onKeyPress' is deprecated.","severity":4,"code":6385,"source":"typescript","relatedInformation":[{"location":{"uri":"file:///home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/node_modules/%40types/react/index.d.ts","range":{"start":{"line":2318,"character":12},"end":{"line":2318,"character":61}}},"message":"The declaration was marked as deprecated here."}]}],"/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/IntroOverlay.tsx":[